1
00:00:00,320 --> 00:00:09,760
There’s never been as big a shock to the semiconductor industry as the current surge in demand from AI. AI is driving incredible computing demand.
人工智能带来的需求激增，对半导体行业造成的冲击前所未有。人工智能正在推动着前所未有的计算需求。

2
00:00:09,760 --> 00:00:13,920
Easily 40-50% above our maximum capacity, which I’ve never seen before.
远超我们最大产能的40%到50%，这我还是头一次见到。

3
00:00:13,920 --> 00:00:17,680
Progress in AI has been driven by exponentially increasing compute.
人工智能的进步得益于计算能力的指数级增长。

4
00:00:17,680 --> 00:00:26,560
To sustain that progress, foundries like Intel will need to manufacture far more leading-edge compute, both by producing more chips and by improving what each chip can do.
为了维持这一进展，像英特尔这样的代工厂不仅需要生产更多先进算力芯片，还必须提升每颗芯片的性能。

5
