they can’t make the chips here. I spent two days touring Intel’s fabs to prepare for these interviews with its leadership. I wanted to understand what it takes to
如果没有这些设备，他们就无法在这里制造芯片。为了准备与英特尔高层的访谈，我花了两天时间参观了英特尔的晶圆厂。

8
00:00:42,240 --> 00:00:47,760
manufacture the world’s most advanced chips and how hardware is shaping the future of AI.
我想弄清楚制造全球最先进芯片需要什么，以及硬件如何塑造人工智能的未来。

9
