How do you fix that? There’s a constant process that we go through in identifying defects. There are two main ways that we’ll identify them.
怎么解决这个问题？我们有一个持续的过程来识别缺陷，主要有两种方法。

24
00:02:18,880 --> 00:02:26,640
One is we have inline metrology. We have tools that will look at the wafers and say, “Ah, there’s a defect there, there’s a defect there, there’s a defect there.”
我们有在线量测技术，工具可以检查晶圆，指出“这里有缺陷，这里有缺陷，这里有缺陷”。

25
00:02:26,640 --> 00:02:32,480
Then also at the end of line, either electrical test or we sort and see where the fails are.
最后在产线末端，要么进行电气测试，要么分拣并查看故障出现在哪里。

26
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:36,800
We will identify failures, and then we will get analysis on those failures.
我们将识别出故障，然后对这些故障进行分析。

27
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:40,640
We’ll cross-section it. You were in the TEM lab yesterday,
我们会进行截面分析。你昨天在透射电镜实验室里已经看到过，

28
